Filesizes under AdVFS can be many TB (16TB or so I think, may be bigger
under recent versions). Even under older versions of ufs filesizes of 128
GB and larger have never really been a problem.
Whether defrag is a good idea depends on what else is going on on that
filesystem.
Adam


